ch_text","block_id":"IW=p"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc8295c0-e64e-4b01-93cb-aa1f364ad94f","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"他の言語が\n```String s = null```\n的な事ができているのは、その型が null も格納できる Object を継承する様な事をしないといけないという意味でこう書いたのですが、伝わらなかった。","ts":"1631896731.338700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8o3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32e61512-1ce1-4df9-b2a7-0daa1229c822","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ポインタを出すメリットはなにか → string が構造体なんです とは?","ts":"1631896196.337300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xQhVe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98907210-6605-49c3-a3eb-d58dc2c563b2","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ん、この QT の繋がりがよくわからない…","ts":"1631896178.336900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JeOSa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10aec0a8-9653-4ea6-a319-f042f669ac42","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"期待というか必要性というか\nGoはすべての需要を満たせるわけじゃないので目的にそぐわなければ向いていませんねで終わりますねえ","ts":"1631895778.336400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AOAk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"106d72a4-d4ee-4549-952a-20cb44ce3008","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まあでも期待に応えてくれない言語を使おう、とはならないわけなので、期待しすぎる人はあなたには Go は向いていませんね、で終わる話なんだよな","ts":"1631895689.335700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XUZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9d98fc8-f9c1-4af5-b160-bf305fe729c7","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"型としてのnilはないはずですね","ts":"1631895581.334800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qiR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b80b541-7e5d-403a-a049-13653d245436","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ところで generics の type list に nil ってどう扱われるんだろう。 `string | nil` 的な事はできないだろうし。","ts":"1631895559.334600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ic8V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b694d78-4e1b-46e1-a06b-6bd65555056f","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"いまやってるこの話もそうなんですが string に null つっこめるかどうかは、言語の仕様ですね。","ts":"1631895473.333700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M6m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b03eb98-6628-46ca-a9b3-65cc2d8865f0","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1438894586638733319\u003e","ts":"1631895446.332900","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/mattn_jp|@mattn_jp\u003e: メリットというか string がプリミティブで non-nil な型(実装が len/cap と ptr を持った構造体)なので綺麗にはできないですね。(その構造体そのものがポインタでなく実体なので)\nスライスも同じメンバを持った構造体。 \u003chttps://twitter.com/dumblepytech1/status/1438890336403611651\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"mattn","author_subname":"@mattn_jp","author_link":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1438894586638733319","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1361128357698572292/61_qdnll_normal.jpg","text":"メリットというか string がプリミティブで non-nil な型(実装が len/cap と ptr を持った構造体)なので綺麗にはできないですね。(その構造体そのものがポインタでなく実体なので)\nスライスも同じメンバを持った構造体。 \u003chttps://twitter.com/dumblepytech1/status/1438890336403611651\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1631894177,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1438894586638733319","original_url":"https://twitter.com/mattn_jp/status/1438894586638733319"},{"color":"32BBF3","fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/dumblepytech1|@dumblepytech1\u003e: 大抵の高級言語は隠蔽してる参照とポインタをユーザーに見せることが、見せないことに対してどうしてメリットがあるんですか？","id":2,"author_name":"medy.nim🐍👑@駆け出しクリプトエンジニア","author_subname":"@dumblepytech1","author_link":"https://twitter.com/dumblepytech1/status/1438890336403611651","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1402938585314037767/iaIlFWxO_normal.jpg","text":"大抵の高級言語は隠蔽してる参照とポインタをユーザーに見せることが、見せないことに対してどうしてメリットがあるんですか？","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1631893164,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/dumblepytech1/status/1438890336403611651"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HLPU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"187927c3-f24f-4e7e-b9a3-89306a345358","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"結局 Go 未経験の人達は Go に期待しすぎてるんですよね。","ts":"1631895433.332700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dzUKc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99e2875d-45a4-49bc-a64f-fb0de20a127f","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"よっぽどマルウェアとかじゃなきゃ、誰かの善意で作られたものなんだし、「悪いソフトウェア」なんてない、\nダメな言語に見えるとしたらそれは適用範囲が非常に少なくて単に他にいいものがあるってことなのかな・・・と思う","ts":"1631895328.332300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CH4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dfcb7d4a-1bf8-4f38-a5ee-7e757e0e4308","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"はい","ts":"1631895151.331000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gEm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0effacf-a8c4-45d8-b9ec-cac8659035c6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Vim は間違いなく人を選ぶので、私は積極的に人に勧めたりはしない。例えば現場に入って「この現場では Vim しか使えません」って言われたら、私はいいんだけど強制される人かわいそうだな、とかは思う","ts":"1631895119.330800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"elbJK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"36ee5965-e2ac-4430-9ef1-54cc80e24fae","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"Vimも悪くない","ts":"1631895059.329400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bi7q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2747d75-478b-4e0d-bc59-0f5508a67607","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Go は人を選ぶ言語だとは思うんですよね。それこそ適切な例えかはわからないけど Vim と同じくらい","ts":"1631895038.329200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nS5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c83f0376-1b28-4edb-8d2d-335d5f1bf791","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"なのでGoは悪くない\n\nついでにRuby on RailsのActiveRecordに対するdisも某所で聞こえたけど、完全に設計が悪くてRoR悪くない案件だった","ts":"1631895002.328700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FfMu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff5aa003-63af-45a1-9e72-735c7d6ed2ef","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"VBA使えと言われると「エーッ」みたいになるしそれと似たような感覚なんだろうな","ts":"1631894993.328300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YG57P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac82a1d7-cfee-43b5-a7cd-c9f2f6ef6b58","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"愛すべき欠点","ts":"1631894974.327200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O23"}]},{"client_msg_id":"254ea92f-bb38-4946-8bee-15eedf9f993d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"それは不幸であるなあ","ts":"1631894952.326700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pwk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2bc4c5e-fcb0-49f4-b7b5-51ac30a7f39d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"その通りなので反論はない","ts":"1631894952.326600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f=1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d34f5f6-853d-4dcb-8540-a183bbbfede1","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"「Goを使わざるを得ない状況に追い込まれる人が増えた」というのもありますね\n例の記事の人がまさにそうで","ts":"1631894943.326400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lc4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ad1415d-6c8e-43a4-ab14-a725ef41ba6c","type":"message","user":"U03C